## 🔥 C++11 Topics (Most Asked → Least)

### 1️⃣ Move Semantics (VERY VERY IMPORTANT)

* rvalue vs lvalue
* rvalue references (&&)
* std::move
* Move constructor & move assignment
* Why needed (avoid deep copy, improve performance)

---

### 2️⃣ Smart Pointers (VERY IMPORTANT)

* unique_ptr
* shared_ptr (reference counting)
* weak_ptr (avoid cycles)
* Ownership semantics

---

### 3️⃣ Lambda Functions (VERY COMMON)

* Syntax: [capture](params){}
* Capture by value / reference
* Use in STL (sort, for_each)
* Mutable lambdas

---

### 4️⃣ Auto Keyword

* Type deduction
* Use with iterators, STL
* Limitations

---

### 5️⃣ nullptr (IMPORTANT)

* Replaces NULL
* Type-safe
* Avoids ambiguity in function overloading

---

### 6️⃣ Range-Based For Loop

* Cleaner iteration over containers
* By value vs reference

---

### 7️⃣ Thread Support (IMPORTANT)

* std::thread
* mutex, lock_guard
* basic concurrency

---

### 8️⃣ Unordered Containers

* unordered_map, unordered_set
* Hashing concept
* Average O(1)

---

### 9️⃣ Delegating Constructors

* One constructor calling another

---

### 🔟 Defaulted & Deleted Functions

* = default
* = delete
* Control object creation

---

### 1️⃣1️⃣ constexpr (Basic)

* Compile-time evaluation
* Simple functions

---

### 1️⃣2️⃣ static_assert

* Compile-time checks

---

